 r←{req}WordCount body;text;top;words;counts;rows
⍝ POST /WordCount   body: {"text":"the cat and the hat", "top":2}
⍝   →  [{"count":2,"word":"the"},{"count":1,"word":"cat"}]
⍝ "top" is optional (default 10). Returns a list of objects.
 :Trap 0
     text←⎕C body.text
     top←{0::10 ⋄ ⍵.top}body
 :Else
     :If 0≠⎕NC'req' ⋄ req.Fail 400 ⋄ :EndIf
     r←⎕NS ⍬
     r.error←'send an object with "text", e.g. {"text":"to be or not to be"}'
     :Return
 :EndTrap
 words←(text∊⎕C ⎕A)⊆text                  ⍝ runs of letters
 :If 0=≢words ⋄ r←⍬ ⋄ :Return ⋄ :EndIf
 counts←words{⍺,≢⍵}⌸words
 rows←↓(top⌊≢counts)↑counts[⍒counts[;2];]
 r←{ns←⎕NS ⍬ ⋄ ns.(word count)←⍵ ⋄ ns}¨rows
